[12] Verdict / next POKE task
  Norm recursion labels help classify residual packets, but the new
  proof-facing geometric carrier is the 14-gonal prism/antiprism annulus:
    V=28 and kappa=1/14.
  It should be tested as the cyclic companion to the q=3 unital
  pair-incidence frame.
  Next concrete experiment:
    build a 28-vertex annular label model with two 14-cycles, attach
    AP/GW/H/D labels, and compare whether the H12/GW/K33 conflict seen
    by the unital becomes a twist, a diameter, or a two-chart obstruction.
